					"nextDialogs": [
						110300224,
						110300225
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留云借风真君"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300224,
					"content": "叙旧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300226
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 110300226,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300227
					],
					"speakerTitle": "甘雨"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300227,
					"content": "啊…那看来有些话不投机吗…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300228
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留云借风真君"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300228,
					"content": "没关系，找话题可是我擅长的事，毕竟千年来很多时候要自己和自己聊天，打发时间。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300229
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留云借风真君"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300229,
					"content": "哦对了，既然是甘雨的朋友，那我给你们讲讲甘雨这孩子小时候的故事吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300230
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留云借风真君"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300230,
					"content": "喂，留云真君！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300231
					],
					"speakerTitle": "甘雨"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300231,
					"content": "哈哈哈…这有什么，你小时候那么可爱，你的朋友们也肯定很想知道吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300232,
						110300233
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留云借风真君"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300232,
					"content": "确实…有点兴趣…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300234
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 110300234,
					"content": "想听想听！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300235
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300235,
					"content": "唉…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300236
					],
					"speakerTitle": "甘雨"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300236,
					"content": "呵呵…甘雨这孩子啊，从小最喜欢的事儿就是被摸摸头上的角。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300237
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留云借风真君"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300237,
					"content": "那会儿我照看她的时候，总是要我摸着角才能入睡…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300238
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留云借风真君"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300238,
					"content": "唔哇…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300239
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300239,
					"content": "…甘雨那时候还胖胖的，胖到什么程度呢？随我上山的时候，只要稍一失足，就会咕噜咕噜滚到山脚…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300240
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留云借风真君"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300240,
					"content": "噗…！！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300241
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300241,
					"content": "…有一天，甘雨撞上一个访仙的人，那是她第一次见到活生生的人类。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300242
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留云借风真君"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300242,
					"content": "想不到居然把她吓得躲在石缝里两天两夜，我找到她的时候，她一边哭一边和我说有怪物…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300243
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留云借风真君"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300243,
					"content": "哈哈哈…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300244
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300244,
					"content": "留…云…真…君！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300245
					],
					"speakerTitle": "甘雨"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300245,
					"content": "…呼，算了，差不多到了「修行」的时间了，我先走了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300246,
						110300247
					],
					"speakerTitle": "甘雨"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300246,
					"content": "甘雨好像有点生气…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300248
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 110300248,
					"content": "唔，我只是想缓解一下你们之前的尴尬而已…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300249
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留云借风真君"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300249,
					"content": "你成功地让尴尬的程度翻了好几倍呢，真是厉害。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300250
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300250,
					"content": "是这样吗…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300251
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留云借风真君"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300251,
					"content": "说回甘雨的事，其实我很欣慰你们能来找她。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300252
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留云借风真君"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300252,
					"content": "我始终觉得，她这样留在绝云间，其实对她来说恐怕不是一件好事…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300253
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留云借风真君"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300253,
					"content": "就让我稍微跟你们讲讲，有关她的事吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300254
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留云借风真君"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300254,
					"content": "…我偶然听到的甘雨心声，就是如此。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300255
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留云借风真君"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300255,
					"content": "内心的困境如果只靠她自己一人，是很难走得出的。所以，希望你们可以暂时陪陪她…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300256
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留云借风真君"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300256,
					"content": "唔，真君说得对，让甘雨继续这样消沉下去的话，也不是办法。而且，被璃月抛弃本来也是她的误会…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300257
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300257,
					"content": "话说，刚才甘雨说的「去修行」是指什么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300258
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300258,
					"content": "她回绝云间以后，一直想要找回身为仙人的感觉，所以提出要我给她安排仙人的修行…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300259
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留云借风真君"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300259,
					"content": "现在她应该在奥藏山南边，准备修行的内容了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300260
					],
					"speakerTitle": "留云借风真君"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300260,
					"content": "原来如此，那我们过去看看！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300247,
					"content": "您讲话好像有点不看气氛…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300248
					]
				},
